Write the following methods that return a lambda expression performing a specified action:

PerformOperation isOdd(): The lambda expression must return svg if a number is odd or svg if it is even.
PerformOperation isPrime(): The lambda expression must return svg if a number is prime or svg if it is composite.
PerformOperation isPalindrome(): The lambda expression must return svg if a number is a palindrome or svg if it is not.

